<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>업로드 링크 오류</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Malgun Gothic", sans-serif; background: #f5f5f4; margin: 0; padding: 24px 16px; }
    .card { max-width: 420px; margin: 80px auto 0; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e5e5e3; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; text-align: center; }
    h1 { font-size: 17px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
    p { font-size: 13px; color: #8a8a86; margin: 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h1><%= reason === 'expired' ? '링크가 만료되었습니다' : '유효하지 않은 링크입니다' %></h1>
    <p>담당자에게 새 업로드 링크를 요청해주세요.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
